WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.237
This slide focuses on A function has a definition
and a call Start with the

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:11.409
meaning of the idea then connect it to the example
and to analytical work A

00:00:11.435 --> 00:00:17.122
function definition tells Python what the function
should do A function call tells Python

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:23.172
